{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"The City of the Great Pit\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"While exploring the Abyss, Riko comes across something she has never seen before. How does this new discovery impact her?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6070050.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"大穴の街\"},{\"title\":\"Resurrection Festival\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Riko and Reg find out more about their past but the question still remains, who or what exactly is Reg?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6174129.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"復活祭\"},{\"title\":\"Departure\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Reg goes on his first cave raid! Meanwhile, Riko makes preparations to go into the abyss to find her mother.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180539.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"出発\"},{\"title\":\"The Edge of the Abyss\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Riko and Reg start their adventure into the Abyss, while there they run into an unexpected familiar face.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180540.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"アビスの淵\"},{\"title\":\"Incinerator\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-04\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Riko and Reg descend into the Forest of Temptation. What new dangers will they find laying in wait for them there?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180541.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"火葬砲\"},{\"title\":\"Seeker Camp\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-11\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Reg and Riko make it to the Seeker Camp where they meet Ozen the Immovable, the person who saved Riko all those years ago. But there is more to Ozen than meets the eye.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180542.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"監視基地[シーカーキャンプ]\"},{\"title\":\"The Unmovable Sovereign\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-18\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Ozen reveals more about the Abyss as well as the truth behind Riko's origins. What will happen when Ozen shows her true colors?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180543.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"不動卿\"},{\"title\":\"Survival Training\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-25\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Ozen tasks Riko and Reg to survive alone outside the Seeker Camp. Do they come out alive and unscathed? Or does the Abyss have a dirty trick up its sleeve?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180544.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"生存訓練\"},{\"title\":\"The Great Fault\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-01\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Reg and Riko continue their descent after they leave Ozen's Seeker Camp. Riko's mettle is tested as Reg passes out and she has to fend for herself.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180545.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"大断層\"},{\"title\":\"Poison and the Curse\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-08\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Reg and Riko run into trouble deep in the fourth layer where they meet an interesting creature, but is she friend of foe?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180546.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"毒と呪い\"},{\"title\":\"Nanachi\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-15\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Nanachi sends Reg on a mission to find certain items that could possibly save Riko. Meanwhile, Nanachi reveals a little more about themself.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/326109/6180547.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ナナチ\"},{\"title\":\"The True Nature of the Curse\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Nanachi shows Reg the truth abou